-- Hover on the type of a builtin module after the dot shows its
-- declaration as the registry has it, written as a program names it
-- (`json.Value` inside `json.Value`), one variant or field a line, and
-- below it the section of a reference page on it: its own (`json.Value`)
-- or, for the module's error enum, the errors page's. An opaque handle
-- shows its name and type arguments.
